pack native-power-maturation
generation control-1
provenance systematic maturation of the 89 native Bonfyre powers, 2026-08-27
authority measured
note Every finding below came from invoking the binary, read-only, never from reading its help text. The pattern is consistent: the powers are real and mostly load-bearing, several carry months of live state nobody reads, and the failures are wiring and measurement rather than capability.

